{"parentUuid":"347dcfca-ddd4-4642-a00f-68e07194d7a2","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d7fd903f-4eab-4718-8a3d-1c392317615c","agentId":"abfed2a994c69f1f0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CA5935qBYVJRMcxZu4HnwR","type":"tool_result","content":"I appreciate your question, but I cannot extract the specific technical details you're requesting from the provided content. The webpage shown is a GitHub repository page header and navigation menu for the FunSearch bin packing notebook, but it does not contain the actual notebook code or implementation details.\n\nTo answer your questions about:\n- The `priority(item, bins)` function signature and return value\n- The `evaluate()` function's operations\n- The number of samples generated\n\nI would need access to the actual notebook content (the code cells), which isn't displayed in this GitHub interface view. You would need to either:\n\n1. Open the notebook directly in Jupyter or GitHub's notebook viewer\n2. Download the raw `.ipynb` file\n3. Navigate to the rendered notebook view on GitHub\n\nI cannot provide specifics about code I cannot see, even with the character and quotation guidelines you've specified."}]},"uuid":"46bb6325-fb62-4aa7-b49f-b9c509cff020","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:31:04.576Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"347dcfca-ddd4-4642-a00f-68e07194d7a2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"4c7df06e-945a-4f77-aa0b-5bbd93440380","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d7fd903f-4eab-4718-8a3d-1c392317615c","agentId":"abfed2a994c69f1f0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016nemF8WyLVHwbTdGbNjY9e","type":"tool_result","content":"# AlphaEvolve Cost and Performance Details\n\nBased on the provided web page content, **specific pricing, cost, iteration count, and time-to-solution benchmarks are not included in this article**.\n\n## What Information IS Available\n\nThe page provides these performance highlights from Google's internal use:\n\n- **Data center efficiency:** 0.7% average recovery of global compute resources\n- **Gemini training:** 23% speedup of a vital kernel, resulting in 1% reduction in Gemini's training time\n- **Hardware design:** Accelerated next-generation TPU design (specific metrics not provided)\n\n## What's NOT Included\n\nThe article does **not** contain:\n- ❌ Pricing or cost per use\n- ❌ Number of iterations required\n- ❌ Time-to-solution for benchmark problems\n- ❌ Compute resource requirements\n- ❌ Usage-based billing information\n\n## Next Steps for Detailed Information\n\nThe article states:\n\n> \"The AlphaEvolve Service API is now available through an Early access program with Google Cloud. If you have one of these problems and are interested in participating in the Early Access Program, please reach out to your Google Cloud Representative.\"\n\n**For specific cost and performance details, you would need to:**\n1. Contact your Google Cloud representative\n2. Request participation in the Early Access Program\n3. Review the [research paper](https://storage.googleapis.com/deepmind-media/DeepMind.com/Blog/alphaevolve-a-gemini-powered-coding-agent-for-designing-advanced-algorithms/AlphaEvolve.pdf) linked in the article for technical details"}]},"uuid":"90b6655a-bf1a-4363-afe7-ce88e8617f90","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:31:09.747Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4c7df06e-945a-4f77-aa0b-5bbd93440380","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"90b6655a-bf1a-4363-afe7-ce88e8617f90","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"abfed2a994c69f1f0","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01QW1DzRLywaNKfk8Rw7qy4c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have sufficient information to compose the report. Let me consolidate.\n\n---\n\n# AlphaEvolve / FunSearch 调研报告（candidate ranking 启发式发现方向）\n\n## 1. FunSearch (DeepMind, Nature 2024)\n\n**核心方法**：冻结的 LLM（论文用 PaLM 2 Codey）反复生成 Python 函数，evaluator 打分，岛屿式进化保留 top-k。LLM 输入是 best-shot prompt——把当前岛屿里得分最高的几个程序拼进 prompt，让 LLM 写\"v3\"。\n\n**关键设计**：\n- 程序骨架（skeleton）固定不变，只演化一个函数体\n- 多岛屿（典型 10 个）防止过早收敛，定期把弱岛重置成强岛后代\n- evaluator 必须确定性、有时间预算（超时即弃）、返回单一 fitness 标量\n- bin packing 的演化函数签名是 `priority(item: float, bins: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray`，返回每个 bin 的优先分；evaluator 在多个 OR-Library 实例上跑，平均\"用了多少 bin\"做 fitness\n- 论文规模：~250 万次 LLM 采样，~100k 次 evaluator 调用，几天到几周（用 Google 内部分布式集群）\n\n## 2. AlphaEvolve (DeepMind, 2025)\n\n**比 FunSearch 进化的点**：\n- 不再只演化单个函数，而是 diff/patch 整个文件（用 SEARCH/REPLACE 块）\n- 双 LLM 集成：Gemini Flash 广撒网 + Gemini Pro 深度建议（论文未公开比例）\n- 评估器可以分级（cheap filter -> expensive validation），节省算力\n- 反馈包含 stderr/profiling artifact，不只是分数\n\n**成果**：4×4 复矩阵乘 48 次（破 Strassen 56 年记录）、Google 数据中心调度恢复 0.7% 全局算力、TPU 电路简化、Gemini 训练 kernel 加速 23%。50+ 数学开放问题里 75% 持平 SOTA、20% 改进。\n\n**注意**：API 是 Google Cloud 早期访问制，不公开定价；无开源实现。\n\n## 3. 开源实现对比（按成熟度排序）\n\n| 工具 | 状态 | LLM 支持 | 关键特性 | 适合度 |\n|------|------|---------|---------|-------|\n| **OpenEvolve** (codelion) | v0.2.27 (2026-03)，活跃，PyPI 可装 | OpenAI/Gemini/Anthropic/Ollama/vLLM | 4 组件流水线、岛屿、artifact 反馈、cascade evaluation | **首选** |\n| **ShinkaEvolve** (Sakana AI) | 2025-09 论文，活跃 | OpenAI/Gemini/local/headless Claude | UCB bandit 选模型、novelty rejection、150 样本破 26-circle SOTA | 次选（更省 token） |\n| **ThetaEvolve** | 2025-11 论文（test-time RL 方向），偏研究 | 开源模型为主 | RL fine-tune evolver | 不推荐 PoC |\n| FunSearch 官方 | 仅结果 + Colab，非生产框架 | PaLM API（已 EOL） | - | 不推荐 |\n\nShinkaEvolve 在样本效率上明显领先（150 samples 解 circle-26，OpenEvolve 文档建议 100-200 起步、AlphaEvolve 论文未披露但显著更多）。两者都用 Apache-2.0。\n\n## 4. LLM/API 选择与成本\n\nOpenEvolve 文档给出的每次迭代成本：\n- o3: $0.15-0.60 / iter\n- o3-mini: $0.03-0.12 / iter\n- Gemini-2.5-Pro: $0.08-0.30 / iter\n- **Gemini-2.5-Flash: $0.01-0.05 / iter**（性价比最高）\n- 本地（Ollama/vLLM 跑 Llama 70B 或 Qwen2.5-Coder-32B）: 免费但慢\n\n**500 代演化估算**：Gemini Flash $5-25、Claude Sonnet $50-150、本地 0 元 + 你电的 GPU 时间。Claude API 走 OpenAI-compatible endpoint（`base_url=https://api.anthropic.com/v1/`）即可接入 OpenEvolve。\n\n## 5. Evaluator 设计原则\n\nOpenEvolve 接口：\n\n```python\nfrom openevolve.evaluation_result import EvaluationResult\n\ndef evaluate(program_path: str) -> EvaluationResult:\n    # 1. 用 importlib 加载 program_path 拿到 rank_score 函数\n    # 2. 用 multiprocessing + signal.alarm 限时（≤100ms/call）\n    # 3. 在历史 campaign 的 candidate 序列上跑 rank\n    # 4. 返回 metrics\n    return EvaluationResult(\n        metrics={\"combined_score\": 0.85, \"kendall_tau\": 0.72},\n        artifacts={\"stderr\": \"...\", \"timeout_count\": 0}\n    )\n```\n\n必须有的护栏：\n- `signal.alarm` + `multiprocessing.Process` 隔离（Windows 上用 `concurrent.futures.ProcessPoolExecutor` + timeout）\n- AST 白名单：禁 `import os/subprocess/socket`、禁 `open()`、禁 `__import__`\n- 内存限制 `resource.setrlimit`（Linux）/ Job Object（Windows）\n- evaluator 必须用固定 seed、固定数据切片，否则 fitness 噪声会污染选择\n\n## 6. 应用到我们 candidate ranking 场景\n\n**接口设计**：\n```python\n# EVOLVE-BLOCK-START\ndef rank_score(candidate: dict, frontier: dict, history: list[dict]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    candidate: {\"w\": int, \"h\": int, \"x\": int, \"y\": int}\n    frontier:  {\"best_area\": int, \"best_min_side\": int, \"remaining_budget_h\": float}\n    history:   list of past attempts: [{\"w\",\"h\",\"status\",\"wall_clock_s\"}, ...]\n    return: float (higher = solve sooner)\n    \"\"\"\n    return candidate[\"w\"] * candidate[\"h\"]  # 退化基线\n# EVOLVE-BLOCK-END\n```\n\n**evaluator 数据来源**：从 `data/checkpoints/` 历史 campaign 抽 100 条 (candidate, time-to-solve, status) 三元组，**严格分 train/val**（前 70% 训进化、后 30% 不可见验证），fitness = val 集上 NDCG@10 或 Kendall-τ vs \"实际 wall-clock 顺序\"。\n\n**关键约束（PROJECT_LOCK 兼容）**：\n- evolved 代码进 `src/ai_sidecar/evolved_rankers/`，纯 hint 用途\n- 永远不写 `data/checkpoints/`、不删 candidate\n- 走 AI 安全合同的 order_only 路径\n- 每次发布前 ultrareview 看 AST：禁 IO、禁随机、禁未来信息（attempt 时不能看到 status 字段，data leakage 防护）\n\n## 7. 风险与边界\n\n- **数值稳定**：LLM 偶尔生成 `1/0` 或 `log(-1)`——evaluator 必须 try/except 并给 -inf\n- **作弊**：把 `status == \"SOLVED\"` 直接当特征用就废了——传给 evolved 函数的 dict 严格剔除未来字段\n- **Data leakage**：演化集 vs 评估集按 campaign hash 分，绝不混\n- **PROJECT_LOCK 定位**：evolved ranker = AI 模块，shadow-only，禁写检查点；进 `forbidden_changes` 清单的反面（可读 Python 反而最容易审）\n\n## 8. PoC 计划（两周）\n\n**Week 1**：\n- D1-D2: `pip install openevolve`（D: 盘新建 venv），跑通官方 `function_minimization` 示例（50 iter, Gemini Flash, 预算 $1）\n- D3: 从 `data/checkpoints/` 导出 100 条 (candidate, t_solve) 当训练集，写 `evaluator.py`，70/30 划分\n- D4: 写 `initial_program.py`（基线 = `area + 0.1 * min_side`，已知能跑），跑 100 iter 看 baseline fitness\n- D5: 跑 500 iter Gemini Flash，看 val Kendall-τ 趋势\n\n**Week 2**：\n- D6-D7: 接入 Claude Sonnet 对比（同样 500 iter，预算 ~$50）\n- D8: AST sandbox 加固，跑随机模糊测试 1000 个 evolved 程序看有没有逃逸\n- D9: 把最佳 evolved ranker 接进 `src/search/outer_search.py` 的 candidate 排序（feature flag 控制，默认 off）\n- D10: shadow run 一次 24h campaign，对比启用/不启用 evolved ranker 的 time-to-first-solve\n\n**评估指标**：\n1. val Kendall-τ vs 真实 solve 顺序（>0.5 算有效）\n2. shadow campaign 里 first-10 候选的命中率（baseline vs evolved）\n3. evolved 代码 AST 复杂度（行数、AST 节点数，>200 节点拒绝部署）\n4. evaluator 平均执行时间 <50ms\n\n**资源**：CPU 够（evaluator 不重）、不需要 GPU（Gemini Flash 走云）。本地兜底用 Ollama + Qwen2.5-Coder-32B（D: 盘约 20GB，单代延迟 ~30s，慢但 0 成本）。\n\n---\n\n**关键链接**：\n- [FunSearch Nature 论文](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-023-06924-6)\n- [FunSearch GitHub (DeepMind)](https://github.com/google-deepmind/funsearch)\n- [AlphaEvolve PDF](https://storage.googleapis.com/deepmind-media/DeepMind.com/Blog/alphaevolve-a-gemini-powered-coding-agent-for-designing-advanced-algorithms/AlphaEvolve.pdf)\n- [AlphaEvolve arXiv 2506.13131](https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.13131)\n- [AlphaEvolve DeepMind blog](https://deepmind.google/blog/alphaevolve-a-gemini-powered-coding-agent-for-designing-advanced-algorithms/)\n- [OpenEvolve GitHub (主推)](https://github.com/codelion/openevolve)\n- [OpenEvolve HuggingFace blog 教程](https://huggingface.co/blog/codelion/openevolve)\n- [ShinkaEvolve GitHub (Sakana AI)](https://github.com/SakanaAI/ShinkaEvolve)\n- [ShinkaEvolve 论文 arXiv 2509.19349](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.19349)\n- [ThetaEvolve 论文 arXiv 2511.23473](https://arxiv.org/html/2511.23473v1)\n- [Hacker News OpenEvolve 讨论](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=44043625)\n\n**一句话结论**：用 **OpenEvolve + Gemini-2.5-Flash** 做 PoC 最经济（500 iter 约 $25），ShinkaEvolve 是省 token 的备选。Evaluator 关键是从历史 campaign 切 train/val、严格 sandbox、绝不让 evolved 代码看到 future 字段。两周可以拿到 shadow 对比数据。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1302,"cache_read_input_tokens":38299,"output_tokens":4132,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1302},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":4132,"cache_read_input_tokens":38299,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1302,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1302,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Caoqs2dQjbRkMwZ71nWGe","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"15a97348-b76f-42a6-b4ef-b500e209de25","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:32:21.355Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
